--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1-  5  A5     ---     ID        Source identifier (prefix + number)
   7- 26  A20    ---     FIRST     FIRST radio source designation (1)
  28- 29  I2     h       RAh       Right ascension (J2000)
  31- 32  I2     min     RAm       Right ascension (J2000)
  34- 38  F5.2   s       RAs       Right ascension (J2000)
      40  A1     ---     DE-       Declination sign (J2000)
  41- 42  I2     deg     DEd       Declination (J2000)
  44- 45  I2     arcmin  DEm       Declination (J2000)
  47- 51  F5.2   arcsec  DEs       Declination (J2000)
  53- 57  A5     ---     Label     Morphological class (2)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Note (1): FIRST designation in the form JHHMMSS.ss+DDMMSS.s.
Note (2): One of sfri (straight FRI), sfrii (straight FRII), wat (wide-angle
     tail), or nat (narrow-angle tail).

